# NOTE: package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored.
# BlueHound pins two git dependencies (cypher-codemirror, react-leaflet-enhanced-marker)
# and ~80 registry packages; without a committed lockfile a fresh clone can
# resolve different code than the machine that was tested. CI prefers `npm ci`
# whenever the lockfile is present.

